## Pattern Comparison

| Aspect | Worktree (Pattern 1) | Main Branch (Pattern 2) |
|--------|---------------------|-------------------------|
| **Scripts** | `setup-worktree.sh` + `deploy-worktree.sh` | `setup-main.sh` + `deploy-main.sh` |
| **Git Operations** | Creates git worktree | Uses existing branch |
| **Numbering** | Yes (preview-3, preview-4) | No (single instance) |
| **Database Naming** | `{PROJECT}_{WORKTREE}_{ENV}` | `{PROJECT}_{ENV}` |
| **Working Directory** | `/worktrees/{NAME}` | Project root |
| **URL Pattern** | `https://{worktree}.trylatest.in` | `https://{repo}.trylatest.in` |
| **Subdomain Param** | `--subdomain staging.{name}` (MANDATORY) | Auto-derived from app-type (not needed) |
| **Branch Param** | `--source-branch {any-existing-branch}` (MANDATORY - can be develop, main, feature/*) | Auto-detected from git (not needed) |
| **Repair Flag** | `--resetup` ⚠️ **DESTRUCTIVE** | `--resetup` ⚠️ **DESTRUCTIVE** |
| **Repair Data Loss** | ❌ **ALL database data wiped** | ❌ **ALL database data wiped** |
| **Repair Confirmation** | ✅ **Interactive prompt required** | ✅ **Interactive prompt required** |
| **Rebuild Modes** | ✅ `--rebuild-full/frontend/backend/migrate` | ✅ `--rebuild-full/frontend/backend/migrate` |
| **Rebuild Data Loss** | ✅ **No data loss (preserves database)** | ✅ **No data loss (preserves database)** |
| **Use Case** | Parallel feature testing | Main branch consolidation |

---

## Decision Tree

**Feature branch / isolated testing?**
→ Pattern 1: Worktree Deployment (`setup-worktree.sh` + `deploy-worktree.sh`)
→ URL: `https://{worktree_name}.trylatest.in`

**Main branch consolidation?**
→ Pattern 2: Main Branch Deployment (`setup-main.sh` + `deploy-main.sh`)
→ URL: `https://{repo_name}.trylatest.in`

